# Roadmap Scope

Phase 1 (Technical MVP) is **CLOSED**.

Phase 2 — Public Alpha Readiness mapping:

1. DND-2.1 Engineering Baseline & CI Hardening
2. DND-2.2 Alpha API Contract & Release Infrastructure
3. DND-2.3 Developer Experience & Documentation
4. DND-2.4 Browser Matrix & Accessibility Baseline
5. DND-2.5 Public Alpha Release Gate

Phase 2 contains **only** DND-2.1 → DND-2.5.

Do not pull into Phase 2:

- Deterministic Auto-Layout (Phase 3)
- AI-assisted layout intelligence (Phase 4, after Auto-Layout)
- Flutter implementation (post-Alpha / Core-contract dependent; not blocked by AI)
- Vue / Angular / Svelte adapters (post-alpha, demand-driven)

Do not turn roadmap ideas into committed calendar dates in docs or code comments unless explicitly asked.

Authoritative roadmap: `docs/roadmap.md`.
